:Once the order is signed off, contact the client and release the order.;
case ([v_decision = '<5k'])
:If the order is worth less than 5.000 €, release it.;
case ([v_decision = '>5k'])
:If the order is worth more than 5.000 €, send it for sign off and continue with the check.;
